# Prod TLS snippet — imported by config/Caddyfile when ANTHIVE_TLS_SNIPPET
# is set to this path (done by ant-supervisor when ANTHIVE_PROD=1).
#
# Intentionally empty: on prod, nginx terminates TLS on :443 and forwards
# plain HTTP to Caddy on 127.0.0.1:8500.  Caddy here speaks no TLS at all.
#
# The file MUST exist (Caddy errors out on a missing import target) but
# it MUST be free of directives — the surrounding site block already
# binds the listener via ANTHIVE_LISTEN.
